omx-panel (0.8.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * version 0.8.1
  * vocabulary: read the unit codes from omx-contract's
    OMX_PARAM_CONTRACT_UNITS
  * packaging: build offline from a vendored source tarball
  * packaging: --version, a reload after install, no stop on upgrade
  * lv2-complement: one bundle reached through two paths is one bundle
  * debian: drop the lintian override for the font the tree no longer has
  * modgui: --check reads the manifest's seeAlso objects as Turtle

